},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/396247625","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/4280#issuecomment-396247625","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/4280","id":396247625,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM5NjI0NzYyNQ==","user":{"login":"MajDroid","id":80091,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid","html_url":"https://github.com/MajDroid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-06-11T13:43:15Z","updated_at":"2018-06-11T13:43:15Z","body":"To summarize our ads setup, we serve the ads in VMAP (Ad Playlist), attached a sample for your reference.\r\n\r\nIn each Ad Pod (such as Preroll), DFP reserves 4 slots for ads as,  these slots might have ads or they might not, this is determined once the DFP receives a request.\r\nSo IMA requests each Ad, DFP determines whether that slot should return an ad or not.\r\n\r\nNow IMA-Extension becomes unreliable and does not play all ads once one or more of those ad slots return empty result (attached is a sample of an empty ad response).\r\nSo In one case, where ads fail to play at in the preroll:\r\nSlot #1 NoAd\r\nSlot #2 NoAd\r\nSlot #3 HasAnAd\r\nSlot #4 NoAd\r\n\r\nanother scenario:\r\nSlot #1 NoAd\r\nSlot #2 HasAnAd\r\nSlot #3 NoAd\r\nSlot #4 HasAnAd\r\n\r\nor another scenario:\r\nSlot #1 NoAd\r\nSlot #2 HasAnAd\r\nSlot #3 HasAnAd\r\nSlot #4 NoAd\r\n\r\nNow results vary with different combination but during my investigation, i noticed that IMA Extension as soon as it receives a LOG event (in other words, an empty ad), it decides to mark the remaining ads with no state as \"error\".\r\n\r\nAttached is a sample [VMAP](https://drive.google.com/open?id=1By_kcBDZbgMfgExoPBH0jFe1EZBhn7_6), [Empty Ad](https://drive.google.com/open?id=1UWJYiGGae_l5dyyA6D5cRJCuafXuAxVe) and [Filled Ad](https://drive.google.com/open?id=1N5j127Oh6I0ND659deEWHkme071JHomh)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/396247625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"MajDroid","id":80091,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid","html_url":"https://github.com/MajDroid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajDroid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/39